# Contributor: StachowiakDawid
pkgname=ais-catcher
pkgver=0.71
pkgrel=0
pkgdesc="AIS receiver for RTL-SDR/SoapySDR with built-in web UI (AIS-catcher)"
url="https://github.com/jvde-github/AIS-catcher"
arch="all"
license="GPL-3.0-or-later"
makedepends="cmake samurai librtlsdr-dev soapy-sdr-dev zlib-dev openssl-dev"
source="$pkgname-$pkgver.tar.gz::https://github.com/jvde-github/AIS-catcher/archive/refs/tags/v$pkgver.tar.gz"
builddir="$srcdir/AIS-catcher-$pkgver"
options="!check" # no test suite

build() {
	# RTL-SDR + SoapySDR (LimeSDR) inputs only; web UI, tracker/API, zlib and
	# TLS (HTTPS/MQTT feeds) on; no databases, resamplers, ZMQ, NMEA2000.
	cmake -B build -G Ninja \
		-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \
		-DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \
		-DRTLSDR=ON -DSOAPYSDR=ON \
		-DAIRSPY=OFF -DAIRSPYHF=OFF -DHACKRF=OFF -DSDRPLAY=OFF -DHYDRASDR=OFF \
		-DSOXR=OFF -DSAMPLERATE=OFF -DZMQ=OFF -DPSQL=OFF -DSQLITE=OFF \
		-DNMEA2000=OFF -DZLIB=ON -DOPENSSL=ON
	cmake --build build
}

package() {
	DESTDIR="$pkgdir" cmake --install build
}
sha512sums="
